  "title": "Devcontainer: coding-agent toolchain, hooks, and git wrapper",
  "summary": "Rebuilds the devcontainer image around a pinned toolchain (moon, Node 22, pnpm, gh, actionlint, uv, Bun) and five coding agents (dsh, omp, opencode, codex, claude-code), each wired to `osf hook` through its own hook mechanism. The git wrapper moves from a system-wide core.hooksPath to forcing /opt/factory/githooks per invocation under OSF_WORKSPACE_ROOT, and build-time tests now prove the wrapper, the agent hooks, and that every agent starts for the dev user.",
